  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>We create modern, minimal and emotionally-driven fine art prints and canvas pieces designed to elevate everyday spaces. Each artwork is created by artist Danelle Messaike and produced using museum-quality materials, made to order and shipped worldwide.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Our pieces are designed to feel personal, calming and timeless — not mass-produced. We focus on high-quality finishes, neutral aesthetics, and artwork that fits seamlessly into modern interiors.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn a 10% commission on every successful order, with a 30-day cookie window. Average order values are strong, making this a great opportunity for content creators in home, lifestyle and interior niches.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>We work best with creators in home decor, interior styling, lifestyle, and aesthetic content. High-performing channels include Instagram, Pinterest, TikTok and blogs.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We provide high-quality product imagery and are open to collaborations with creators who align with our brand.</p></div></div>",
